# The reference emulators' prebuilt libretro cores, fetched from the libretro buildbot's nightlies by
# `build-probe.sh libretro-core <core>` into ~/.cache/emusen/probe/libretro/cores and used only if the
# unpacked core's SHA-256 is the one pinned here. Black boxes: only the binary is unpacked, and no
# firmware is ever fetched. Re-pinning is a deliberate edit of this file. Nephrite_Native.md §8, Diamond_References.md §3.
